     A** FEE SCHEDULE SYSTEM - A/R MASTER FILE
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PAR01                     TEXT('A/R MASTER FILE')
     A            ARCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            ARSUB#    R               REFFLD(SUB#)
     A            ARFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            ARFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            ARSYS     R               REFFLD(SYS)
     A            ARCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            ARTRCD    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('TRANS CODE' '(A/R TYPE)')
     A            ARTRTP    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('TRANS TYPE' 'I,A,P,V,S,N')
     A            ARTRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('TRANSACTION' 'DATE')
     A            ARPODT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('POSTING' 'DATE')
     A            ARDESC    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A            ARAMT     R               REFFLD(A92)
     A            AREOB#    R               REFFLD(EOB#)
     A                                      COLHDG('EOMB SQ NUMBER')
     A            ARSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            ARUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            ARPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            ARTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            ARDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            ARCK#     R               REFFLD(CHK#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CHECK' 'NUMBER')
     A*** BEG CHG *** 12/11/98 ****************************************
     A            ARINV#    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('INVOICE' 'NUMBER')
     A**********  ARINV#    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A**********                            COLHDG('INVOICE' 'NUMBER')
     A*** END CHG *** 12/11/98 ****************************************
     A*** BEG ADD *** 12/11/98 ****************************************
     A            ARRCN     R               REFFLD(RCN)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECON NUMBER')
     A*** END ADD *** 12/11/98 ****************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 11/30/00 **************************************
     A*
     A* THESE FIELDS WILL BE USED TO TRACK THE "TRUE" CASE# WHEN A/R
     A* IS POSTED TO THE "SUMMARY" CASE (IE. 000-0000000).
     A*
     A            ARXYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A                                      COLHDG('TRUE (XREF) YEAR')
     A            ARXCAS    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A                                      COLHDG('TRUE (XREF) CASE')
